---
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
// HOSE rules example 3: a buy order of 1,000 shares (limit 40,850) walks the ask side.
// Before: asks 900@40,800, 500@40,850, 200@40,900; best bid 100@40,650.
// After: 900 bought at 40,800 and 100 at 40,850, so 40,800 is empty and 40,850 holds 400.
// Mid-price: (40,650 + 40,800)/2 = 40,725 -> (40,650 + 40,850)/2 = 40,750.
const W = 900, H = 412, SC = 0.2, Y0 = 98, RH = 36;
const before = [{ p: '40,900', q: 200 }, { p: '40,850', q: 500 }, { p: '40,800', q: 900 }];
const after = [{ p: '40,900', q: 200 }, { p: '40,850', q: 400 }, { p: '40,800', q: 0 }];
const panels = [{ x: 20, rows: before, bid: 100, mid: '40,725', midVi: '40.725' }, { x: 500, rows: after, bid: 100, mid: '40,750', midVi: '40.750' }];
---
<figure class="f">
  <div class="f-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Before and after a buy order of 1,000 shares. Before: asks of 200 at 40,900, 500 at 40,850 and 900 at 40,800, best bid 100 at 40,650, mid-price 40,725. The order buys 900 shares at 40,800 and 100 at 40,850. After: the 40,800 row is empty, 40,850 holds 400, the best bid is unchanged, and the mid-price is 40,750, up 25 dong.">
    <DiagramIcon name="chart" x={24} y={20} size={22} />
    <text x="46" y="26" class="f-h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>A buy order walks up the sell side</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Một lệnh mua đi dọc lên phía bán</tspan>
    </text>
    {panels.map((pn, k) => (
      <g>
        <rect x={pn.x} y="46" width="380" height="276" rx="8" class="f-panel" />
        <text x={pn.x + 16} y="72" class="f-ann">
          {k === 0
            ? <><tspan data-lang-en>Before</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Trước</tspan></>
            : <><tspan data-lang-en>After</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Sau</tspan></>}
        </text>
        {pn.rows.map((r, i) => (
          <g>
            <text x={pn.x + 16} y={Y0 + i * RH + 18} class="f-price"><tspan data-lang-en>{r.p}</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>{r.p.replace(',', '.')}</tspan></text>
            {r.q === 0
              ? <rect x={pn.x + 90} y={Y0 + i * RH} width="180" height="28" rx="4" class="f-gone" />
              : <rect x={pn.x + 90} y={Y0 + i * RH} width={r.q * SC} height="28" rx="4" class="f-ask" />}
            {r.q === 0
              ? <text x={pn.x + 100} y={Y0 + i * RH + 18} class="f-faint"><tspan data-lang-en>all 900 bought</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>900 đã bị mua hết</tspan></text>
              : <text x={pn.x + 90 + r.q * SC + 8} y={Y0 + i * RH + 18} class="f-qty">{r.q}</text>}
          </g>
        ))}
        <text x={pn.x + 16} y={Y0 + 3 * RH + 20} class="f-faint"><tspan data-lang-en>… empty steps …</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>… các bước giá trống …</tspan></text>
        <text x={pn.x + 16} y={Y0 + 4 * RH + 18} class="f-price"><tspan data-lang-en>40,650</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>40.650</tspan></text>
        <rect x={pn.x + 90} y={Y0 + 4 * RH} width={pn.bid * SC} height="28" rx="4" class="f-bid" />
        <text x={pn.x + 90 + pn.bid * SC + 8} y={Y0 + 4 * RH + 18} class="f-qty">{pn.bid}</text>
        <text x={pn.x + 16} y="306" class="f-mid-t">
          <tspan data-lang-en>mid-price {pn.mid}</tspan>
          <tspan data-lang-vi>giá giữa {pn.midVi}</tspan>
        </text>
      </g>
    ))}
    <polygon points="414,170 444,170 444,158 474,184 444,210 444,198 414,198" class="f-arrow" />
    <text x="444" y="222" text-anchor="middle" class="f-ann is-gold"><tspan data-lang-en>buy 1,000</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>mua 1.000</tspan></text>
    <text x="20" y="352" class="f-ann"><tspan data-lang-en>Filled: 900 shares at 40,800 and 100 at 40,850.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Khớp: 900 cổ phiếu ở 40.800 và 100 ở 40.850.</tspan></text>
    <text x="20" y="376" class="f-ann is-gold"><tspan data-lang-en>The best ask moved up one step, so the mid-price rose 25 VND with no change on the bid side.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Giá bán tốt nhất nhích lên một bước, nên giá giữa tăng 25 đồng dù phía mua không đổi.</tspan></text>
    <text x="20" y="398" class="f-sub"><tspan data-lang-en>Quantities in shares. Order and fills as in HOSE's worked example.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Khối lượng tính bằng cổ phiếu. Lệnh và kết quả khớp lấy từ ví dụ của HOSE.</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>One order clears the cheapest sellers and leaves the best ask a step higher. That step is the "price impact" of this order.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Một lệnh quét sạch những người bán rẻ nhất và để lại giá bán tốt nhất cao hơn một bước. Bước đó chính là "tác động giá" của lệnh này.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .f { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .f-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .f svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .f text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .f .f-h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .f .f-sub { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .f .f-price { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; fill: var(--text); }
  .f .f-qty { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; fill: var(--text); }
  .f .f-faint { font-size: 12px; fill: var(--text-muted); font-style: italic; }
  .f .f-ann { font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 600; fill: var(--text); }
  .f .f-ann.is-ask, .f .f-ann.is-red { fill: var(--red); }
  .f .f-ann.is-bid, .f .f-ann.is-green { fill: var(--act-2); }
  .f .f-ann.is-gold { fill: var(--gold-icon); }
  .f .f-mid-t { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .f-ask { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.3; }
  .f-bid { fill: color-mix(in srgb, var(--act-2) 16%, var(--bg)); stroke: var(--act-2); stroke-width: 1.3; }
  .f-empty { fill: none; stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; stroke-dasharray: 4 4; }
  .f-gone { fill: none; stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.3; stroke-dasharray: 4 4; }
  .f-mid { stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 1.8; stroke-dasharray: 6 4; }
  .f-lead { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; fill: none; }
  .f-panel { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .f-card { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .f-arrow { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.3; }
  .f-axis { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .f-grid { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; stroke-dasharray: 3 4; }
  .f figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
